1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,039
For this thrift trip I'm not really going in with an idea of anything.
这次淘衣，我没带着明确目标进去。

2
00:00:03,039 --> 00:00:07,600
I'm just going to get whatever calls to me whatever I find really cute.
我就挑那些吸引我、自己觉得可爱的东西。

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,559
I'm not going to get as much this time since I'm about to leave.
这次不会买那么多，因为马上要出发了。

4
00:00:10,559 --> 00:00:14,639
I will try to find some tops that I can bring with me to my study abroad.
我会尽量找些能带去留学时穿的上衣。

5
00:00:14,639 --> 00:00:17,360
But I'm already packed so I don't really have a lot of room.
不过行李已经收好了，实在没多少空间。

6
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,920
So we'll just go with the flow and see how it goes.
所以就顺其自然，看看情况吧。

7
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,559
The first thing I found was this cute little cropped cardigan.
第一件收获是这件可爱的短款开衫。

8
00:00:22,559 --> 00:00:26,160
If you watch my other videos you would know how obsessed I am with cardigans like this.
看过我其他视频的人，都知道我有多迷这种开衫。

9
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:29,760
I actually love cheetah print so much right now so when I found this I had to grab it.
我最近真的很喜欢猎豹纹，所以看到这件就得拿下。

10
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:32,549
It was 15 so not too bad I think it could work.
它是15块，不算太差，我觉得能搭得不错。

11
00:00:32,559 --> 00:00:36,480
Then I spotted this cardigan I mean it doesn't look that great right now on the hanger.
接着我发现这件开衫，现在挂在衣架上看着不怎么样。

12
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:41,200
But I just know cardigans like this at this point and it was abcom so I knew it would be good.
但到现在我已经了解这种开衫了，而且是那个牌子，所以觉得会不错。

13
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:46,549
I really like the pearls on this blouse I thought it was more of like an elevated office look so I wanted to try it on.
我很喜欢衬衫上的珍珠细节，感觉像更精致的职场造型，所以想试穿。

14
00:00:46,559 --> 00:00:52,960
This one I was a little unsure about but I thought the collar was pretty cool and these little strings so it had potential.
这一件我有点犹豫，但领子和小系带很有趣，觉得有潜力。

15
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,640
Next we have this striped sweater.
接下来是这件条纹毛衣。

16
00:00:54,640 --> 00:01:11,910
I don't know why I gave such a disapproving look because I don't think it looks that bad but I decided not to get it.
不知道自己为什么露出嫌弃的表情，其实没那么差，但我还是没买。

17
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:15,679
Denim blazers are one of the items that I will always grab if I see it.
牛仔西装外套是我只要看见就一定会拿起来的单品。

18
00:01:15,679 --> 00:01:20,880
But this one was okay it looked a little plain but I wanted to wait to try it on to see.
但这件只是还行，有点普通，我想先试上身再决定。

19
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:27,040
I thought this one could be like a cute more fitted style and I could style it that way but I was a little unsure about it as well.
我想这一件也许能穿成比较合身的造型，不过同样有点拿不准。

20
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:30,320
Time to take a little break from the clothes so I headed over to the bags.
该稍微休息一下，不看衣服，转去看包了。

21
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:43,590
I not always successful in the bags but it's fun to look through.
看包不一定每次都有收获，但翻看还是很有意思。

22
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,119
Then I checked the shoes as well.
然后我也看了看鞋。

23
00:01:45,119 --> 00:01:47,439
My brain always goes to anything cheetah print.
我总会先注意到任何猎豹纹的东西。

24
00:01:47,439 --> 00:01:50,310
I didn't end up getting anything even though there were some cute pieces.
虽然有些单品很可爱，但我最后什么也没买。

25
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:59,350
But they were either not my size or a little overpriced for my liking.
它们不是尺码不对，就是价格超出我的接受范围。

26
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:02,239
I also found this gold frame that I think is gorgeous.
我还发现这个金色画框，觉得很漂亮。

27
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:16,870
But I decided to put it back because I don't need more room decor right now.
但还是放回去了，因为我现在不需要更多房间装饰。

28
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:21,840
Here's everything I found so far and now it's time to head back to the main room again to look through all the racks.
这是目前找到的东西，现在回主厅，再翻翻所有衣架。

29
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:26,800
The long sleeve section in this store is really big right now so I was in here for a while.
现在这家店的长袖区很大，所以我在这里待了挺久。

30
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,040
And I honestly did not find that many things.
说实话，我并没找到多少东西。

31
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:35,360
It gets a little unmotivating when I haven't found something in a while but I always know that you just need to push through.
一阵子找不到好物会有点泄气，但我知道得继续坚持找。

32
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:45,590
And if you have good music playing in the meantime then it's not as bad.
而且同时听着喜欢的音乐，就没那么难熬。

33
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:48,640
Off the shoulder pieces are also ones that I like to gravitate towards.
露肩单品也是我总会被吸引过去看的。

34
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:54,950
But this one kind of had a weird shape so I didn't get it.
但这件形状有点奇怪，所以没买。

35
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:59,920
I actually really enjoy looking through the tank top section because they're so easy to look at.
我其实很喜欢逛背心区，因为看起来很方便。

36
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:02,080
I can usually go through them pretty quickly.
通常我能很快把它们看完。

37
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:06,160
But again on this trip I honestly didn't find that many great pieces here.
不过这次，我在这里确实也没找到多少好单品。

38
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:10,160
But it really only takes one gem because look at this beautiful dainty lace top.
但其实只要一件宝贝就够了，看这件精致漂亮的蕾丝上衣。

39
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:14,640
I got really excited about this one because I love the cowl neck and the little tie details on the side.
我看到这件特别兴奋，很喜欢荡领和侧边小系带的细节。

40
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:18,559
And here's another little office siren tank I think it could be really cute.
还有这件偏办公室女郎风的背心，我觉得会很可爱。

41
00:03:18,559 --> 00:03:23,520
Last section to check is the short sleeves I found this really cute brown blazer top.
最后看短袖区，我发现这件很可爱的棕色西装风上衣。

42
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:27,760
And look how adorable this little baby tea is it's snoopy in paris.
再看这件小T恤多可爱，上面是巴黎的史努比。

43
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:35,190
But I decided not to get because pink isn't really my color but I regret this so much now.
但我没买，因为粉色不太适合我，现在真的后悔了。
